  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "25616828",
      "title": "Adding Custom Components & CSS Modules",
      "sourceHash": "2204df3e9a12c59821555821203975e8d06f7c7ed4a2aed209fe568bf04482eb",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.02,
          "end": 3.78,
          "en": "So for this MeetupDetail page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.78,
          "end": 6.37,
          "en": "I'll add a new functional component inside",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.37,
          "end": 8.41,
          "en": "of that meetupId page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.41,
          "end": 11.75,
          "en": "the MeetupDetails component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.75,
          "end": 15.24,
          "en": "And I'll then export this as a default.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15.24,
          "end": 17.31,
          "en": "Oops, like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 17.31,
          "end": 18.99,
          "en": "Not MeetupList.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 18.99,
          "end": 22.15,
          "en": "Like this and then here we return the content",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 22.15,
          "end": 24.47,
          "en": "for the MeetupDetails page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 24.47,
          "end": 26.6,
          "en": "Now, here it's, of course, up to you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 26.6,
          "end": 30.91,
          "en": "how you wanna display the details for a given item.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 30.91,
          "end": 32.93,
          "en": "I will output a fragment,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 32.93,
          "end": 34.8,
          "en": "which we need to import from react",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 34.8,
          "end": 38.73,
          "en": "so that we can have multiple adjacent JSX elements.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 38.73,
          "end": 42.52,
          "en": "And I'll then start by outputting the image",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 42.52,
          "end": 43.9,
          "en": "of that meetup item",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 43.9,
          "end": 46.433,
          "en": "with some src and some alt text.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 47.43,
          "end": 51.78,
          "en": "Now, of course, later we will actually get the concrete data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 51.78,
          "end": 54.01,
          "en": "for a specific meetup item here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 54.01,
          "end": 58.3,
          "en": "At the moment, we don't really have any meetup data source.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 58.3,
          "end": 61.91,
          "en": "We have this dummy array in the root index.js file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 61.91,
          "end": 63.63,
          "en": "but it's only available in there",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 63.63,
          "end": 66.58,
          "en": "and whilst we could export this constant",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 66.58,
          "end": 69.44,
          "en": "and then also use it in the MeetupDetail page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 69.44,
          "end": 70.93,
          "en": "I will not do this here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 70.93,
          "end": 74.77,
          "en": "because we're soon going to connect a real backend anyways.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 74.77,
          "end": 76.03999999999999,
          "en": "And therefore, for the moment,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 76.03999999999999,
          "end": 78.83,
          "en": "I'll just hard code some data in here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 78.83,
          "end": 81.55,
          "en": "and I'll grab that data from the dummy data though,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 81.55,
          "end": 84.31,
          "en": "so from this DUMMY_MEETUPS array",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 84.31,
          "end": 87.24,
          "en": "and I'll copy the image link here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 87.24,
          "end": 89.53999999999999,
          "en": "and use that as a source.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 89.53999999999999,
          "end": 94.53999999999999,
          "en": "And the alt text could be A First Meetup like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 94.72999999999999,
          "end": 98.02000000000001,
          "en": "Then below that, I will add a h1 tag",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 98.02000000000001,
          "end": 101.69,
          "en": "where I say A First Meetup and then below that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 101.69,
          "end": 106.44,
          "en": "a paragraph with The meetup description.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 106.44,
          "end": 110.28999999999999,
          "en": "And we can also add a address element here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 110.28999999999999,
          "end": 112.93,
          "en": "which is a default HTML element",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 112.93,
          "end": 114.893,
          "en": "where we have the address.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 116.31,
          "end": 117.33,
          "en": "Like that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 117.33,
          "end": 120.21,
          "en": "That could be how we output the MeetupDetails,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 120.21,
          "end": 122.98,
          "en": "for the moment, with some dummy data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 122.98,
          "end": 126.24,
          "en": "And if I add this here in the MeetupDetails component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 126.24,
          "end": 128.43,
          "en": "if we reload this MeetupDetails page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 128.43,
          "end": 130.093,
          "en": "this is what we see.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 131.01,
          "end": 134.82,
          "en": "And that's okay but of course, not the final style",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 134.82,
          "end": 136.62,
          "en": "which I'd like to have.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 136.62,
          "end": 139.3,
          "en": "I'd like to center all the text actually",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 139.3,
          "end": 144.02,
          "en": "and I would also like to shrink the image a little bit.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 144.02,
          "end": 146.54,
          "en": "Now, for that, I haven't prepared any styles,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 146.54,
          "end": 149.62,
          "en": "so we can just quickly add some styles together here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 149.62,
          "end": 153.22,
          "en": "and for this, I'll actually add a brand new component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 153.22,
          "end": 155.34,
          "en": "in the component's meetups folder,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 155.34,
          "end": 157.543,
          "en": "which I'll name MeetupDetail,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 159.32999999999998,
          "end": 162.24,
          "en": "like this and you don't have to create this component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 162.24,
          "end": 166.81,
          "en": "I just like to keep my page component files pretty lean",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 166.81,
          "end": 169.93,
          "en": "and outsource as much JSX code as possible",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 169.93,
          "end": 171.85,
          "en": "into standalone components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 171.85,
          "end": 174.73,
          "en": "But that is not something you have to do.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 174.73,
          "end": 176.53,
          "en": "Nonetheless, I will do it here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 176.53,
          "end": 178,
          "en": "and I'll copy that fragment",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 178,
          "end": 181.21,
          "en": "from the MeetupDetails page component here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 181.21,
          "end": 185.91,
          "en": "and add it to the MeetupDetail single component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 185.91,
          "end": 189.073,
          "en": "And create that MeetupDetail component here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 190.06,
          "end": 194.22,
          "en": "And of course, also export MeetupDetail here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 194.22,
          "end": 199.22,
          "en": "and return that JSX code here then like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 199.57999999999998,
          "end": 202.34,
          "en": "And actually, accept props already",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 203.25,
          "end": 206.96,
          "en": "and expect that I get this data through props now",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 206.96,
          "end": 210.14,
          "en": "so that the data will be fetched in the page component later",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 210.14,
          "end": 212.65,
          "en": "and will then passed into this component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 212.65,
          "end": 213.94,
          "en": "which is then responsible",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 213.94,
          "end": 217.4,
          "en": "for actually presenting the content.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 217.4,
          "end": 220.39,
          "en": "So here we then have props.image.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 220.39,
          "end": 224.5,
          "en": "Here for alt, we could use props.title.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 224.5,
          "end": 229.49,
          "en": "What we then also use here for the h1 tag, props.title.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 229.49,
          "end": 233.977,
          "en": "And here for the address, that would be props.address",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 234.93,
          "end": 237.21,
          "en": "and here we have the description.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 237.21,
          "end": 239.253,
          "en": "Props.description.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 240.11,
          "end": 243.83,
          "en": "And on the MeetupDetails page component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 243.83,
          "end": 247.29,
          "en": "we can now output this MeetupDetail component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 247.29,
          "end": 248.96,
          "en": "we just worked on.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 248.96,
          "end": 249.97,
          "en": "And for this, of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 249.97,
          "end": 253.35,
          "en": "import this MeetupDetail component up there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 253.35,
          "end": 255.64,
          "en": "And now we just need to pass that data,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 255.64,
          "end": 257.78,
          "en": "which we expect in that component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 257.78,
          "end": 261.093,
          "en": "through props into that MeetupDetail component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 262.83,
          "end": 266.15,
          "en": "So here we can then add the image property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 266.15,
          "end": 268.28,
          "en": "and then use our dummy image link",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 269.53,
          "end": 272.83,
          "en": "or our dummy image content here for the moment.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 272.83,
          "end": 274.71,
          "en": "Set the title prop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 274.71,
          "end": 277.053,
          "en": "First Meetup could be the title.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 278.2,
          "end": 283.2,
          "en": "Set the address prop to Some Street 5, Some City",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 284.57,
          "end": 287.63,
          "en": "and last but not least, set the description prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 287.63,
          "end": 290.633,
          "en": "to this is a first meetup.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 291.65,
          "end": 293.82,
          "en": "And then we can get rid of the fragment",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 293.82,
          "end": 296.69,
          "en": "and that JSX content in the page component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 296.69,
          "end": 299.51,
          "en": "and just use the MeetupDetail component here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 299.51,
          "end": 301,
          "en": "Now, why am I doing that?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 301,
          "end": 303.88,
          "en": "Again, just to keep the JSX code lean here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 303.88,
          "end": 306.67,
          "en": "and now also for styling reasons.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 306.67,
          "end": 309.49,
          "en": "We could have also imported a CSS file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 309.49,
          "end": 310.62,
          "en": "in the page component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 310.62,
          "end": 314.16,
          "en": "This would work, it is a regular component after all.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 314.16,
          "end": 316.77,
          "en": "But I like to keep my pages folder lean",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 316.77,
          "end": 320.48,
          "en": "and only have the page JS files in there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 320.48,
          "end": 322.65,
          "en": "Now, for the other components on the other hand,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 322.65,
          "end": 325.81,
          "en": "it is quite common that we pair a JavaScript file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 325.81,
          "end": 327.55,
          "en": "with a CSS file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 327.55,
          "end": 328.8,
          "en": "and again, we could have done that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 328.8,
          "end": 330.41,
          "en": "in the pages folder as well",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 330.41,
          "end": 332.74,
          "en": "but I wanna keep that folder leaner.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 332.74,
          "end": 334.28,
          "en": "Here for the components folder,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 334.28,
          "end": 337.15,
          "en": "it is more common to include these CSS files",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 337.15,
          "end": 338.95,
          "en": "and hence here I'll now also add",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 338.95,
          "end": 343.27,
          "en": "a MeetupDetail.module.css file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 343.27,
          "end": 346.24,
          "en": "The .module.css is important by the way.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 346.24,
          "end": 350.34000000000003,
          "en": "We already used it all the time here silently so to say",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 350.34000000000003,
          "end": 353.15,
          "en": "because I provided all these components to you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 353.15,
          "end": 355.35,
          "en": "but this actually unlocks a feature",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 355.35,
          "end": 358.35,
          "en": "called CSS modules.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 358.35,
          "end": 361.68,
          "en": "It's a feature which you might know from standard React.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 361.68,
          "end": 365.29,
          "en": "It allows you to scope CSS class styles",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 365.29,
          "end": 368.66,
          "en": "to a React component and it is supported out",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 368.66,
          "end": 371.73,
          "en": "of the box in NextJS projects.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 371.73,
          "end": 374.71,
          "en": "If you name a CSS file like this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 374.71,
          "end": 377.53,
          "en": "ending with .module.css",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 377.53,
          "end": 380.6,
          "en": "and you then import it into your JavaScript file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 380.6,
          "end": 383.48,
          "en": "in a certain way, which I'll show you in a second,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 383.48,
          "end": 388.22,
          "en": "then the CSS styles defined in the CSS file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 388.22,
          "end": 390.9,
          "en": "will be scoped to this component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 390.9,
          "end": 394.443,
          "en": "At least if you use CSS classes as selectors.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 395.4,
          "end": 397.3,
          "en": "Now, that special way of importing",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 397.3,
          "end": 399.9,
          "en": "can bee seen in the other JavaScript files.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 399.9,
          "end": 401.2,
          "en": "It looks like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 401.2,
          "end": 405.1,
          "en": "We import classes or however you wanna name it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
